      "text": "Pohlkamp says Orlov made sure to grab his 1st NHL goal puck. What's going to happen with it? Pohlkamp said it's probably going into his room, adding, \"My dad might build something cool. He's a woodshop teacher. Hopefully, it doesn't collect too much dust.\"",
